          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൂട്ടുകുടുംബം — kūṭṭukuṭumbaṁ — \"a joint family\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പണ്ട് ഗ്രാമങ്ങളിൽ കൂട്ടുകുടുംബങ്ങൾ സാധാരണമായിരുന്നു. paṇṭŭ grāmaṅṅaḷil kūṭṭukuṭumbaṅṅaḷ sādhāraṇamāyirunnu. Long ago joint families were common in the villages."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൂട്ട് together + കുടുംബം: several families under one roof."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കൂട്ടുകുടുംബം (kūṭṭukuṭumbaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from കൂട്ട്, \"joining, company\", which is native (DEDR 1882), and കുടുംബം, from Sanskrit kuṭumba, \"a household\" (CDIAL 3233)."
            }
          ]
        },
