              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇണങ്ങുക — iṇaṅṅuka — \"to be reconciled; to make up\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വഴക്കിന് ശേഷം കുട്ടികൾ വേഗം ഇണങ്ങി. vaḻakkinŭ śēṣaṁ kuṭṭikaḷ vēgaṁ iṇaṅṅi. After the quarrel the children soon made up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഇണങ്ങി, iṇaṅṅi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The opposite of പിണങ്ങുക, to sulk. It also means to get used to a place or a person."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇണങ്ങുക (iṇaṅṅuka) is native Dravidian: DEDR 457 lists it with ഇണ, \"a pair, a mate\", and verbs for suiting and uniting (DEDR 457)."
            }
